<title>HONG KONG: Glorious Sun, other HK retailer shrs slip.</title>
<headline>Glorious Sun, other HK retailer shrs slip.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Glorious Sun Enterprises and other retailers ran into some profit-taking on Wednesday after strong rises in recent trade due to optimism about Chinese consumer spending, traders said.</p>
<p>Glorious Sun was down HK$0.375 at HK$3.55 in afternoon trade while shares of Giordano International fell HK$0.60 to HK$7.60 and First Sign International slipped HK$0.05 to HK$2.525.</p>
<p>&quot;Some of the retail stocks, after getting pushed up quite strongly, are coming off a bit,&quot; said Geoff Galbraith, institutional sales at Nava SC Securities.</p>
</text>
